# Schema Linking — Step by Step (On-Prem to On-Prem)

**Source SR:** node1/2/3.alldataint.com:8081 (DEV)  
**Destination SR:** node-all-service.alldataint.com:8081 (UAT)  
**Dijalankan dari:** node1 (source side)

---

## Step 1 — Validasi Konektivitas

Pastikan node1 bisa reach SR di node-all-service:

```bash
curl -sk https://node-all-service.alldataint.com:8081/ \
  -u admin:P@ssw0rd
```

> ✅ Expected output: `{}`

---

## Step 2 — Buat File config.txt

File ini berisi URL dan kredensial **destination** (node-all-service):

```bash
cat > /tmp/config.txt << 'EOF'
schema.registry.url=https://node-all-service.alldataint.com:8081
basic.auth.credentials.source=USER_INFO
basic.auth.user.info=admin:P@ssw0rd
schema.registry.ssl.truststore.location=/var/ssl/private/kafka_connect.truststore.jks
schema.registry.ssl.truststore.password=confluenttruststorepass
EOF
```

---

## Step 3 — (Opsional) Set Mode IMPORT di Destination

Lakukan ini hanya jika subject `db_ecommerce.db_ecommerce.orders-value` **sudah ada** di destination SR dengan ID yang berbeda. Ini memastikan schema ID dari source dipertahankan saat di-import.

```bash
# Set mode IMPORT untuk subject key
curl -sk -X PUT \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -u admin:P@ssw0rd \
  --cacert /var/ssl/private/kafka_connect.truststore.jks \
  https://node-all-service.alldataint.com:8081/mode/db_ecommerce.db_ecommerce.orders-key \
  --data '{"mode": "IMPORT"}'

# Set mode IMPORT untuk subject value
curl -sk -X PUT \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -u admin:P@ssw0rd \
  --cacert /var/ssl/private/kafka_connect.truststore.jks \
  https://node-all-service.alldataint.com:8081/mode/db_ecommerce.db_ecommerce.orders-value \
  --data '{"mode": "IMPORT"}'
```

> ⚠️ Jika subject belum ada di destination, skip step ini.

---

## Step 4 — Verifikasi Schema Ada di Source SR

Pastikan schema yang akan di-link sudah terdaftar di source SR (node1):

```bash
# Cek list subjects di source
curl -sk https://node1.alldataint.com:8081/subjects \
  -u admin:P@ssw0rd

# Cek detail schema orders-key
curl -sk https://node1.alldataint.com:8081/subjects/db_ecommerce.db_ecommerce.orders-key/versions/latest \
  -u admin:P@ssw0rd | python3 -m json.tool

# Cek detail schema orders-value
curl -sk https://node1.alldataint.com:8081/subjects/db_ecommerce.db_ecommerce.orders-value/versions/latest \
  -u admin:P@ssw0rd | python3 -m json.tool
```

> ✅ Pastikan subject sudah ada sebelum membuat exporter.

---

## Step 5 — Buat Schema Link dengan Confluent CLI

```bash
confluent schema-registry exporter create schema-link-ecommerce \
  --context-type NONE \
  --config-file /tmp/config.txt \
  --schema-registry-endpoint https://node1.alldataint.com:8081 \
  --ca-location /var/ssl/private/kafka_connect.truststore.jks \
  --subjects db_ecommerce.db_ecommerce.orders-key,db_ecommerce.db_ecommerce.orders-value
```

> **Penjelasan flag:**
> - `--context-type NONE` — subject name di destination sama persis dengan source (tidak ada prefix)
> - `--config-file` — file berisi URL & kredensial destination
> - `--schema-registry-endpoint` — URL SR **source** (node1)
> - `--ca-location` — CA certificate untuk SSL
> - `--subjects` — subject yang akan di-sync, pisahkan dengan koma

> ⚠️ Jika ingin sync **semua subject** sekaligus, hilangkan flag `--subjects` dan tambahkan `--subject-format ":.*:"`

---

## Step 6 — Cek Status Schema Link

```bash
confluent schema-registry exporter get-status schema-link-ecommerce \
  --schema-registry-endpoint https://node1.alldataint.com:8081 \
  --ca-location /var/ssl/private/kafka_connect.truststore.jks
```

> ✅ Expected output: status `RUNNING`

---

## Step 7 — Verifikasi Schema Sudah Ter-sync di Destination

```bash
# Cek subjects sudah muncul di destination
curl -sk https://node-all-service.alldataint.com:8081/subjects \
  -u admin:P@ssw0rd

# Verifikasi schema ID sama antara source dan destination
echo "=== Source ===" && \
curl -sk https://node1.alldataint.com:8081/subjects/db_ecommerce.db_ecommerce.orders-value/versions/latest \
  -u admin:P@ssw0rd | python3 -c "import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('ID:', d['id'])"

echo "=== Destination ===" && \
curl -sk https://node-all-service.alldataint.com:8081/subjects/db_ecommerce.db_ecommerce.orders-value/versions/latest \
  -u admin:P@ssw0rd | python3 -c "import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('ID:', d['id'])"
```

> ✅ Angka `ID` harus **sama** antara source dan destination.

